{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood of the North </strong>is a survival game with roguelite elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, build, and battle dragons to reclaim what was lost to the North.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel between islands, explore ancient lands, and rebuild what was destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, fortify buildings, and strengthen your hero to face increasingly dangerous enemies \u2014 alone or with a friend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESOURCE GATHERING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island, gather useful materials, and manage your inventory to develop your base and unlock new opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/e2eb744bbe483c4a04c10085608de99f.poster.avif?t=1762531886\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/e2eb744bbe483c4a04c10085608de99f.webm?t=1762531886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/e2eb744bbe483c4a04c10085608de99f.mp4?t=1762531886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILDING CONSTRUCTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build workshops, weapon shops, and taverns to expand your settlement's capabilities. Each building opens up new paths for development and strengthens your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/a5ccfca04f19edcaa4707d7e2c2eda2c.poster.avif?t=1762531886\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/a5ccfca04f19edcaa4707d7e2c2eda2c.webm?t=1762531886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/a5ccfca04f19edcaa4707d7e2c2eda2c.mp4?t=1762531886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRAGON BATTLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to other islands and engage in fierce battles with dragons. Each battle is a test, a reward, and a chance to become stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/a9ca00e510a06bb4613dad0e6f827cfb.poster.avif?t=1762531886\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/a9ca00e510a06bb4613dad0e6f827cfb.webm?t=1762531886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/a9ca00e510a06bb4613dad0e6f827cfb.mp4?t=1762531886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or cooperatively. Joint battles make survival even more interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/597d7bf37e622834c8d83f166effad72.avif?t=1762531886\" width=778 height=369 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088290?t=1762531886","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088290?t=1762531886","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/0d555e4f9fe0e0e45eff0d2f2d22926b9905f35e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762531886","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s